WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0066: a stand-in's WoW body for BG3's examine and trade previews.

- portrait: a fifth body booth, wowbg3body (576x768, its own layer before the glue booth's), aimed
  like the inspect pane by sync_wowbg3_body at the unit and turn wowbg3::drive_body sets.
- portrait/wowbg3.rs drive_body: while link/wowpreview.txt names a stand-in (RenderScreen.lua: the
  screen, its previews, the stand-in's, its guid and BG3's turn of it), renders that unit every frame,
  animated and turned with BG3's preview, and writes every readback to the live file (WOWBG3_SHM when
  it is set, named in link/wowbody/live.path; a header and two frame slots). In between it bakes a
  still per mirrored display (link/wowbody/d<display>.rgba) and writes link/wowbody/<guid>.txt (display,
  WoW race, creature type, NPC flags). The capture layer draws the body over BG3's preview; PreviewRaces.lua
  names the race in BG3's screens.

